# Untracked in every case, so a CI checkout does not have these and a working
# tree does. Without the entry a local run reports findings CI cannot see, which
# is the same as having no local run at all: the output is noise you learn to
# scroll past. .claude/ is the agent's own scratch directory; the rest is what
# .gitignore lists under "Internal-only".
/.claude/
/CLAUDE.md
/GROK_OUTPUT.md
/.review.md
/.task.md
/docs/TODO.md
/docs/spec-draft.md
/docs/security-audit-*.md
